ay:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;color:#666\">\n      <span>{{ taxNote }}<\u002Fspan>\n      <a href=\"/pricing\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#111\">See full pricing ↗<\u002Fa>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fsection>\n\n  <!-- Process -->\n  <section data-screen-label=\"WDA / Process\" style=\"max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(64px,8vw,112px) clamp(12px,2.4vw,32px)\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,52px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.05em\">How a project runs <span style=\"color:#9A9890\">week by week<\u002Fspan><\u002Fh2>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,230px),1fr));gap:0;border-top:1px solid #DDDCD6\">\n      <div style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px 0;border-right:1px solid #DDDCD6\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#888\"><span>01<\u002Fspan><span>Week 1<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;font-weight:500;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">Call and proposal<\u002Fh3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#555\">A 20-minute call on Google Meet, phone or in person, then a written scope and fixed price.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px;border-right:1px solid #DDDCD6\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#888\"><span>02<\u002Fspan><span>Weeks 1–2<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;font-weight:500;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">Design<\u002Fh3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#555\">Wireframes and a clickable prototype you review and approve.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px;border-right:1px solid #DDDCD6\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#888\"><span>03<\u002Fspan><span>Weeks 3–5<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;font-weight:500;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">Build on staging<\u002Fh3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#555\">A private link that updates daily, with a written note each Friday.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"padding:24px 0 8px 24px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#888\"><span>04<\u002Fspan><span>Week 6<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;font-weight:500;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">Launch and handover<\u002Fh3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#555\">Go live, transfer accounts, recorded walkthrough, support period starts.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fsection>\n\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section data-screen-label=\"WDA / FAQ\" style=\"max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(12px,2.4vw,32px) clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\">\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(28px,5vw,72px)\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#555;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><span style=\"width:5px;height:5px;background:#111\"><\u002Fspan>FAQ<\u002Fdiv>\n        <h2 style=\"margin:18px 0 0;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,52px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.05em\">Hiring a web development agency in India <span style=\"color:#9A9890\">: common questions<\u002Fspan><\u002Fh2>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\">\n        <details style=\"border-radius:16px;background:#ECEBE6;padding:0 20px\"><summary style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">How much does it cost to hire a web development agency in India?<span style=\"flex:none;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fsummary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 0 20px;color:#555\">A website is ₹40,000 for up to 50 pages with basic SEO and Google Business Profile included, extra pages are ₹5,000 each, online stores start at ₹50,000, landing pages at ₹20,000, SEO is ₹35,000 a month and ads management ₹30,000 a month, plus GST. Every project gets a fixed written quote.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdetails>\n        <details style=\"border-radius:16px;background:#ECEBE6;padding:0 20px\"><summary style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Do you work with businesses outside Chennai?<span style=\"flex:none;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fsummary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 0 20px;color:#555\">Yes. We work with businesses across India over Google Meet, phone and email, with GST invoices, weekly updates and a staging link that updates as we build.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdetails>\n        <details style=\"border-radius:16px;background:#ECEBE6;padding:0 20px\"><summary style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:64px;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Who owns the code and the website?<span style=\"flex:none;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fsummary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 0 20px;color:#555\">You do. Once the project is paid in full, the code, design files and content are yours.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdetails>\n        <details style=\"border-radius:16px;background:#ECEBE6;padding:0 20px\"><summary style=\"display:flex;justi